      "comment": "CATCH A BUTTERFLY (9) is stepping out for the first time. By top sire Captaintreacherous and hails from the Emma Stewart stable. Full sister to multiple Group 1 winner Catch A Wave. Has been trialling well and is sure to be well educated. Capable of taking this out despite a second row draw. ALWAYS BE VICKI NZ (6) is a three-year-old daughter of Always B Miki on debut for the Craig Demmler stable. Has strong trial form coming into this, winning two hitouts at Melton. Expect a strong showing. LIL SPARROW (3) is another at the track for the first time. By Stay Hungry and hails from the Butler stable. Won a trial and a nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. FLYING JACKIE (2) draws well and could improve off a good effort on debut last start, finishing runner-up at Shepparton.",
